sequenceDiagram
    participant MD as CPlayStatisticsDlg
    participant TD as CStatTrendTabDlg
    participant CH as CTrendChart
    participant PA as OnPaint(CStatChart)
    participant DC as CDrawCommon
    participant ST as m_str_table

    MD->>TD: SetContext(&m_context)
    TD->>TD: Refresh() 聚合 ComputeBuckets/ComputePeriodComparison
    TD->>CH: SetData(buckets, period, new_songs, grain)
    TD->>CH: Invalidate(FALSE)
    CH->>PA: WM_PAINT
    PA->>DC: Create(&dc, GetFont())
    PA->>DC: FillRect(rect, StatPalette::DialogBack())
    PA->>CH: DrawChart(draw, pDC, rect)
    CH->>ST: LoadText / LoadTextFormat(TXT_STAT_TREND_*)
    ST-->>CH: 本地化字符串
    CH->>DC: SetFont(GetFontBySize(StatFont::Title))
    CH->>DC: FillRect / DrawLine / DrawWindowText
    Note over CH: 无 SS_OWNERDRAW，无 OnDrawItem，无 CreatePointFont，无中文字面量
